{"src":"en","tgt":"uk","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"uk","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7941.886855,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8864.573816,"text":"Шеньчженська зона, однак, у цьому відношенні працює дещо як одна країна."},{"kind":"audio","t":8973.083425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8978.251361999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8983.324250000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8985.348438,"samples":15102,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":15115.140267000002,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":16142.468838,"text":"Розташована на вершині однієї з гір на північ від Мекки, печера знаходиться зовсім"},{"kind":"audio","t":16242.352705000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16246.948221000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16252.206277000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16256.696795,"samples":29312,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"input","t":17741.907108,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18168.867785000002,"text":"відірваною від решти світу."},{"kind":"audio","t":18213.482149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18215.032014,"samples":12928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":26292.951026000002,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27633.104737,"text":"Тепер люди пишуть повідомлення на екранах комп'ютерів, і їм більше ніколи не доводиться наближатися до стругачки."},{"kind":"audio","t":27756.633844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27761.502436000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27766.593094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27771.912889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27776.8207,"samples":30538,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"input","t":37546.879874,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39356.438430999995,"text":"Мандрівники, які прямують до країн із високими податками, іноді можуть заощадити значну суму грошей, особливо на таких товарах, як алкогольні напої та тютюн."},{"kind":"audio","t":39535.272380999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39540.232461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39545.364838999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39550.521625999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39555.648514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39561.154135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39565.165771,"samples":32154,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"input","t":45790.403558,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46692.321981999994,"text":"Рослини виготовляють свою їжу з сонячного світла за допомогою фотосинтезу. Вони також забезпечують тінь."},{"kind":"audio","t":46800.535935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46805.195820999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46810.449206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46813.226021999995,"samples":19560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"audio","t":46818.831532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46820.749951,"samples":14600,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":58075.262459,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59458.564637999996,"text":"Лікарня дотримувалася протоколу контролю інфекцій, зокрема ізолювала пацієнта від інших, щоб запобігти можливому зараженню інших."},{"kind":"audio","t":59611.784118999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59616.853717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59622.150612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59627.630784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59633.50851,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59639.156168999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59639.511684,"samples":2619,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":68183.063182,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69385.585692,"text":"Виконана робота була переважно теоретичною, але програма була написана для симуляції спостережень за галактикою Стрілець."},{"kind":"audio","t":69542.841328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69547.742769,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":69552.91284599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":69558.196301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69563.24753,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69567.089039,"samples":23962,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"input","t":78316.484464,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79668.7375,"text":"Офіційними мовами Барселони є каталонська та іспанська. Приблизно половина віддає перевагу каталанській мові, переважна більшість розуміє її, а практично кожен знає іспанську."},{"kind":"audio","t":79772.644942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79777.76125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79781.731967,"samples":26136,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":79824.036108,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79828.984648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79833.659583,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79836.87497199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79840.225798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79841.538827,"samples":16996,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":83800.439428,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84809.78057799999,"text":"У деяких районах достатньо кип'ятити воду одну хвилину, а в інших потрібно кілька хвилин."},{"kind":"audio","t":84909.664965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84914.94084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84920.133567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":84925.153316,"samples":30705,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"input","t":89857.417345,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":91025.617396,"text":"Рослини виглядають найкраще в природному середовищі, тому втримайтеся від спокуси видалити навіть одну стеблину."},{"kind":"audio","t":91146.596094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91151.737431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91157.220803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91162.540028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91167.166644,"samples":29702,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"input","t":97274.950336,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98513.11865399999,"text":"Протягом 1920-х років панівними настроями більшості громадян і держав були пацифізм та ізоляціонізм."},{"kind":"audio","t":98615.214195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98620.259294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98625.51311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98630.53889,"samples":31820,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"input","t":103529.99109499999,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104631.899149,"text":"Маса Сериф був найвищим хижаком свого часу, тому не боявся нічого, окрім інших Мосулів."},{"kind":"audio","t":104738.43449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104743.570207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104748.576517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104753.761744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104755.25244,"samples":10755,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":113142.242211,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114629.447872,"text":"З моменту заснування Асунсьона в 1537 році Парагваю вдалося зберегти значну частину свого корінного характеру та ідентичності."},{"kind":"audio","t":114761.40618399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114766.26991599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114771.62170999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114776.980034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114782.137861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114783.817144,"samples":12817,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":119871.726455,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120660.263119,"text":"Хворобу переносять свині, після чого вона передається людям через комарів."},{"kind":"audio","t":120748.332845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120753.27769599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120758.45615299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120759.47813599999,"samples":8972,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":129363.051882,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130665.51914699998,"text":"Більшість сучасних дослідницьких телескопів — це величезні комплекси у віддалених районах зі сприятливими атмосферними умовами."},{"kind":"audio","t":130811.45928499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130816.75297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130823.067239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130827.50273800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130832.790473,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130838.399653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130838.55828,"samples":3455,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":135224.785933,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136247.977261,"text":"Люди можуть і не здогадуватися, що для мандрівників також необхідні терпіння та розуміння."},{"kind":"audio","t":136350.92816799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136355.82068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136361.144694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":136366.478339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136366.712325,"samples":5461,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":140541.125637,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141211.894951,"text":"Тож, імовірно, позначення було додано просто як мітка."},{"kind":"audio","t":141282.478068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141287.550297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141290.983282,"samples":18891,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":147771.00115999999,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148610.309599,"text":"Але в птахах досі багато чого, що нагадує динозавра."},{"kind":"audio","t":148680.785638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148685.893936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148688.216239,"samples":16662,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":154958.127469,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":155942.947723,"text":"Це майже всі піщані пляжі з безпечним купанням, і на більшості з них є затінок від"},{"kind":"audio","t":156039.290676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156045.853161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156051.053338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156054.902486,"samples":25133,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1010},{"kind":"input","t":157900.14373,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158178.637001,"text":"дерев Погікана."},{"kind":"audio","t":158212.530027,"samples":30928,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1180},{"kind":"input","t":164347.371104,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165721.4673,"text":"Дювал, який одружений і має двох дорослих дітей, не справив великого враження на Міллера, якому розповіли цю історію."},{"kind":"audio","t":165855.780265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165860.720295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165865.834843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165870.936651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165876.169597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165879.634132,"samples":22848,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"close","t":175905.373932,"code":1005}]}